; Device table for the DAPI device manager (vEvalDeviceConfig). The real unit
; gets this from an encrypted region file (ni2k_eur/DAPIAPP.ERG). Paths are
; limited to 29 chars by dap_tclDevPath. DEVICE_NAV_1 is the navigation SD
; card addressed through the OSAL dispatcher, i.e. its device path doubles as
; the data mount prefix (/dev/cryptnav/CFG/... for the DB files) and is what
; bRegPRMNotifications hands to OSAL_s32IOControl(0x7ffffffc), which strcmps it
; against libosal's PRM table names (/dev/cryptnav). _PRM is the control
; device whose open+ioctl register the PRM media-status callback.
