; NOTE (r788, f43 vs f44): PROCESS\CONFIG\PROCNAVI APPID is queried by
; PROCNAV's own monitor threads (scd_s32GetThreadConfiguration), NOT by the
; HMI enavi client - seeding it changed nothing on the bus.  The key is
; deliberately absent again; the enavi client's real precondition lives
; elsewhere (see docs/issues/correctness.md r788).
